  "description": "Production-ready .NET Standard 2.1 peer-to-peer communication library for local networks. Features auto-discovery via UDP broadcast, secure authentication, bidirectional messaging, and mesh networking. Perfect for building distributed applications that need to discover and communicate with each other automatically. 100% test coverage.",
