  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1 - Documentation Update\n• Enhanced README with NuGet installation instructions\n• Added 5-minute tutorial for quick start\n• Improved package documentation and examples\n• Added debugging support information\n• Updated NuGet package metadata\n\nv1.0.0 - Initial Release\n• Peer-to-peer mesh networking with auto-discovery\n• UDP broadcast-based peer discovery\n• TCP reliable messaging with JSON serialization\n• Pre-shared key authentication\n• Bidirectional text messaging\n• Connection/disconnection detection\n• Event-driven architecture\n• 100% test coverage (176/176 tests passing)\n• Interactive demo application included",
